# Proof receipts

- Every significant visual task writes a receipt with executionStatus, startingHead, endingHead, paidCreateCount, paidSpendUsd, and finalClassification.
- Record SHA256 and path for every proof still.
- Classify each class honestly. PARTIAL is allowed inside notes; the terminal state is still PASS, FAIL, or BLOCKED.
- Do not mark PASS because a PNG file exists. The image contents must meet the acceptance text.
- Keep receipts next to the stills they describe.
